# JVM crash dumps. A hotspot crash writes these into the working directory, so
# they appear beside pom.xml rather than under target/. They are large, they are
# specific to one machine and one crash, and they record the full command line,
# which on this project includes the MongoDB connection string.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

